# Task 6 – Ethernet Port Report

## 1. Diagnosis
Late collisions and CRC errors combined with Half Duplex indicate a **Duplex Mismatch**[cite: 2].

## 2. Linux Fix
`sudo ethtool -s eth0 speed 100 duplex full autoneg on`[cite: 2]

## 3. Addressing
- `01:00:5e:0a:01:02`: IPv4 Multicast MAC address[cite: 2].
- `3c:52:82`: Organizational Unique Identifier (OUI)[cite: 2].
